  "description": "«Hyung is pretty.»\nEven after being warned not to, Hong Seo Woo, overdoes it and gets drunk at his club’s welcoming party. The next day, he wakes up in the clubroom and realizes that not only did he miss his morning class, but while he was asleep...he’s been holding hands with a stranger, who also happens to be a man — one of the club’s new recruits and Seo Woo’s junior, Baek Do Hyeon. Drawn into joining the club after seeing him, Do Hyeon plans on gaining Seo Woo’s affections, even if it is proving to be quite the challenge.",
